# A radial menu: aim the right stick at an item while RB is held; letting go chooses it.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
press rb
advance 100
stick right 1 0
advance 100
release rb
advance 100
stick right 0 0
---
overlay menu "Radial"                  @0
sound menu Open pop                    @0
sound menu Step click                  @100
overlay menu "Radial" selected "Right" @100
sound menu Pick pop                    @200
overlay none                           @200
sound menu Close pop                   @200
key KEY_R down                         @200
key KEY_R up                           @200
